      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sylmar%2C_Los_Angeles"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Four months after the 1971 earthquake, a methane gas explosion in a water tunnel beneath Sylmar killed 17 workers, marking California’s worst tunneling disaster.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sylmar%2C_Los_Angeles"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The 2008 Sayre Fire destroyed 489 homes in and around Sylmar, the largest residential loss ever recorded in Los Angeles history.",
